From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Date: Wed, 1 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm/bridge: lt9611: drive the bridge for the k230 display

Drive the LT9611 MIPI DSI to HDMI bridge as the K230 display pipeline
uses it. The bridge registers its own HDMI connector, reads the EDID to
list the modes, accepts the 1080p modes it supports and programs the
MIPI receiver, PLL and pixel clock recovery with values tuned for the
K230 DSI output. The audio codec, enable GPIO, regulator and next
bridge paths are not used and are removed.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/lontium-lt9611.c | 698 +++++++++++-------------
 1 file changed, 311 insertions(+), 387 deletions(-)

